      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree bea4d1e73717ac8aec14885a9b790d0e19003143\nparent a0c977f3755da6476b955677ca9318334a2432c4\nauthor Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1790923174 +0200\ncommitter Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1793832970 +0100\n\nBIP-352: add test vectors for malleated p2pkh pubkey extraction\n\nAdd two p2pkh inputs whose scriptSig also pushes another valid pubkey.\n\nIn `<sig> <pubkey> <bogus_sig> OP_OVER OP_CHECKSIG OP_IF <other_pubkey>\nOP_ENDIF`, evaluating the scriptSig with a checker that accepts any\nsignature leaves <other_pubkey> on top of the stack. This is the\nscriptSig of the test added in bitcoin/bitcoin#36338.\n\nIn `<other_pubkey> OP_DROP <sig> <pubkey>`, taking the first 33-byte\npush without checking its hash finds <other_pubkey>.\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRJ5SMZs3eEinN+Lb4iedqLwmlHIAUCauu4ChsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQInnai8JpRyCZIAD8Dhe9UpjR8XXRacLzmFsd\neNR5nE3j3MYvGCUlFkLOvpYBANpa/cMa+6jatUu3BTTbFpwAX0yh0YaaMik5OfHb\nMJYB\n=TCB/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----"
